Z||000000||fldevel||07-11-2000||09:23 PM|||| this was kinda a fun one ..this black integra passed me  at like 80 mph and cut me off ..i got  a little mad but was in a good mood for the trophy i won at the car show for best of show so i caught up to him and paced him untill the next light when he raced his engine and yelled over .."ya wanna go " and pointed down the road racing his motor so i gave him the nod...the light turned green and i punched it what this? hees right on my tail so i pushed in the clutch and swich to 3rd i was a car leingth ahead when i swiched to 4th ..then the next light turned red so i secided to slow and he puled into the turn lane ..we turned down the road and into the gas station whare he was telling me damn thats a fast little car .what ya got in it ? i sed a little v6 u? he opened his hood and it looked like a space ship in there  ..a blown v-tech!!!! <BR>he showed me all his mods and what he had done to it ..musta talked for about 20 min and he apoligized for cutting me off and he asked me what i had in my car ..so we walked over and hees standing in front of the car waiting to see the engine (pause for laughter) "oh the engine is in the back???"<BR>so i showed him my completely stock V6 as he looked in awe "damn thats a fast little car "  i guess its another kill to put in the records   <P><p>[This message has been edited by fldevel (edited 07-11-2000).]||||reg||1
